## ✅ Summary - What You Should Have
```
imtiaz-mart-event-driven/
├── .gitignore  ← Contains: infrastructure/.env
│
├── infrastructure/
│   ├── .env.example  ← Template (commit this)
│   ├── .env          ← Real secrets (DON'T commit)
│   ├── .gitignore    ← Contains: .env
│   └── docker-compose.yml
│
└── services/
    └── user-service/
        └── .env.example  ← Template (optional, for local dev)
